WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.165
AI scores every job from zero to a hundred
against your profile, and says why:

2
00:00:05.165 --> 00:00:07.020
what fits, and what's missing.

3
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:12.131
Then add your own rules,
in plain words, in any language.

4
00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:13.670
Priorities, nice-to-haves, deal-breakers.

5
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.351
Add one: no ad-tech.

6
00:00:16.351 --> 00:00:20.330
Over the next runs, the ad-tech job
falls from sixty-five to fifteen.

7
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.690
Your rules.
Your ranking.
